    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The night sky blankets The Gardens. 12 figures are busy around me. Reef Spiritfree (gardener) is here, practicing. grey fog cloaks everything in white. The world is stark and hushed under winter.</description>
